  grade: 'Class 6',
  emoji: '⛰️',
  chapterText:
      'Dr. Kavita Rao had spent fifteen years studying the rare snow leopards that roamed the remote slopes '
      'of Silent Peak, a mountain so treacherous that few expeditions ever attempted its higher ridges. Her '
      'research team consisted of just three members: herself, a local guide named Tenzin, and a young '
